From 4acec061b86817839ee857a8db3919a376c7db78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Ewen <ryan.ewen@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 22:17:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Agent host: keep a Claude steering message on screen

Steering folds into the running turn instead of starting a new one, so
removing the pending bubble on SDK ack left the message with no
representation anywhere: the model visibly changes course, and nothing
in the transcript says why.

Remember the text and turn when the steer is enqueued, and write it into
that turn as a quoted markdown part at the moment the bubble is removed.
The turn itself is untouched, so CONTEXT.M10 (steering folds into the
in-progress Turn) still holds.
